    "terrainName": "cqb-village",
    "description": "What: on cqb-village a STOCHASTIC 'Blue Stochastic Squad' (10 men from the TKB composite) holds the village's three-storey house 'OBJ' (StochasticUnitDefend); a PHYSICAL 'Red Squad' stands 480 m north - inside the resolution manager's band, so the squad de-aggregates. Judge (D-P3, end to end): while the squad is Planning, SquadDefend's OWN plan runs over its slot table and asks the house's window / door / roof posts; the manager waits for that plan, then creates the 10 men (each with its stable key, named <squad>/<slot>) ON those posts: every man inside the house, at least 5 on the upper storey, at least 5 at the wall facing the enemy; and they still hold the house 20 s later. Fail: a man on the fallback line outside the house, the men created before the plan is Ready, or a missing / re-keyed man. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh agg-squad-holds-house"
  },
